      "answer": "cargo in a folder with rust-toolchain.toml auto-installs the toolchain (rustup 1.29.1); opt out with RUSTUP_AUTO_INSTALL=0 or `rustup set auto-install disable`; `rustup show` warns and recommends `rustup install`",
