    },
    {
      "item": "std sort algorithms",
      "answer": "slice::sort = driftsort-based (stable, linear on sorted/reversed); sort_unstable = ipnsort-based; select_nth_unstable = introselect on ipnsort. .NET Array.Sort/List.Sort = introsort (unstable); LINQ OrderBy stable",
      "source": "Rust slice docs 'Current implementation'; Microsoft Learn Array.Sort & Enumerable.OrderBy"
    }
  ],
